<title>BELGIUM: ELECTRORAIL UNIT SELLS PRODATA SYSTEMS TO LCI.</title>
<headline>ELECTRORAIL UNIT SELLS PRODATA SYSTEMS TO LCI.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Electrorail said on Wednesday its Giga Industries subsidiary sold its entire holding in Prodata Systems to the Dutch LCI computer group.</p>
<p>Electrorail said Giga Industries made a capital gain on the sale, but it gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
